VALUES ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_nrc_322'), 1, 'After saveCourseDetails runs, which cached entry should become out of date, and by what string was that entry labelled when it was stored? Then ask the same question for changeCoursePrice.'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_nrc_322'), 2, 'Put the tags side by side: the one in the tags option of getCourse and the one each action passes to the cache. Look at every character. Then check the second action: does it tell the cache anything at all? Finally, choose between the two cache functions by what the instructor must see on the next read.'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_nrc_322'), 3, 'A similar case on a different page: getLesson is cached with tags [`lesson:${id}`], and the action saveLessonBody calls updateTag(`lessons/${id}`). Reading lesson 5, saving its body and reading again prints the old body as a HIT. With one helper lessonTag(id) used by both the reader and the action, the read after the save is a MISS with the new body, and the read after that is a HIT; lesson 6, read before the save, is still a HIT.');
